linux-patch-api (2.6.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix OpenRC health-check race condition that orphaned agent process (PR #198)
  * Replace curl health check with /proc/net/tcp port check (mTLS-compatible)
  * Add 30s retry loop for port readiness
  * Do not return 1 from start_post when process is alive (prevents orphaning)
  * Add pgrep fallback in post-upgrade to kill orphaned processes

